            {
                "entry_id": "9db7ca95-c8f6-3a2f-9fd0-a78ecfe5806f",
                "word": "ironworks",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "501ddd5c-681e-48cd-bacb-dd5a665d4587",
                        "entry_id": "9db7ca95-c8f6-3a2f-9fd0-a78ecfe5806f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "ironworks"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0a0caa5c-71ad-3bc3-89f2-b10d1398378b",
                        "entry_id": "9db7ca95-c8f6-3a2f-9fd0-a78ecfe5806f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A factory in which iron is manufactured or iron goods are made."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c704268e-a00d-4369-bb31-3fc053fd1974",
                                "sense_id": "0a0caa5c-71ad-3bc3-89f2-b10d1398378b",
                                "text": "But, like more than one similar North Wales beauty-spot, there had to be (at least at the time of which I write), a quarry, or ironworks, or some kind of industrial plant, which lay perpetually under a cloud of yellowish smoke—literally a blot on the landscape."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8cffb264-03c3-46d0-9a8b-1bc553f47ed9",
                                "sense_id": "0a0caa5c-71ad-3bc3-89f2-b10d1398378b",
                                "text": "Many of its cottages were built for quarrymen when local workings provided limestone for the great 19th-century ironworks at Nantyglo."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "70abe747-0011-4f6a-ada8-0e6e27ccc8fb",
                        "source_entry_id": "9db7ca95-c8f6-3a2f-9fd0-a78ecfe5806f",
                        "source_sense_id": "0a0caa5c-71ad-3bc3-89f2-b10d1398378b",
                        "source_sense_description": "factory",
                        "target_lang_word": "ferronnerie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ferronnerie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "da866e2d-910f-3035-9778-49a1d22abdc3",
                                        "entry_id": "42e6bcd8-9afb-3140-b5b9-3959c2f0c25b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lieu où l’on fabrique, où l’on vend les gros ouvrages de fer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Industrie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "75f49044-f1ee-34e2-8872-0a750110cb6a",
                                        "entry_id": "42e6bcd8-9afb-3140-b5b9-3959c2f0c25b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Art du ferronnier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c907e4fc-9584-44f7-8183-e357dfd79440",
                                                "sense_id": "75f49044-f1ee-34e2-8872-0a750110cb6a",
                                                "text": "À l’école, il a appris à lire et à écrire. Il a travaillé dans la ferronnerie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad6ce70d-71a2-3ad0-9ac8-4c9499539641",
                                        "entry_id": "42e6bcd8-9afb-3140-b5b9-3959c2f0c25b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ces ouvrages de fer, fabriqués par le ferronnier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27808913-5bc0-4c95-ae6c-bdcc84a751a9",
                                                "sense_id": "ad6ce70d-71a2-3ad0-9ac8-4c9499539641",
                                                "text": "Combien de balcons en ferronnerie, de mascarons, de pilastres nous restituent l’image de ce que fut cette cité au XVIᵉ, au XVIIᵉ, au XVIIIᵉ siècle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1bf30b6-bb71-4872-a07e-0987928a04e7",
                                                "sense_id": "ad6ce70d-71a2-3ad0-9ac8-4c9499539641",
                                                "text": "Deux rues plus loin, il ouvrit un lourd portail, garni de riches ferronneries, qui donnait sur une petite cour intérieure."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "66a0eb58-efc6-46b5-b997-15e1c4163083",
                        "source_entry_id": "9db7ca95-c8f6-3a2f-9fd0-a78ecfe5806f",
                        "source_sense_id": "0a0caa5c-71ad-3bc3-89f2-b10d1398378b",
                        "source_sense_description": "factory",
                        "target_lang_word": "Eisenwerk",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Eisenwerk",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e9d832d1-b197-32e4-aae8-110615de4267",
                                        "entry_id": "07df9ede-8353-3bdd-9604-884dfd0808d1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "technische Anlage, in der aus Eisenerzen Roheisen erzeugt wird"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5a95502-2355-4ff9-833a-f885645bb77e",
                                                "sense_id": "e9d832d1-b197-32e4-aae8-110615de4267",
                                                "text": "„Die Eisenwerke in der südwestlich von Siegen gelegenen Grafschaft Sayn-Altenkirchen, in welche die Siegener Erzgänge, besonders der berühmte Hollerter Zug übersetzten, waren im Mittelalter von geringer Bedeutung.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "598f735e-fb05-306a-bb4d-9b9220d85cd6",
                                        "entry_id": "07df9ede-8353-3bdd-9604-884dfd0808d1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gesamtheit eiserner Gegenstände"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "no-plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c179fd09-f4de-47a3-81ea-a22fa1a5212f",
                                                "sense_id": "598f735e-fb05-306a-bb4d-9b9220d85cd6",
                                                "text": "Wir haben Vorräte an Eisen und allerlei daraus geschmiedetes Zeug und Eisenwerk."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
